      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_24139ea1",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: the_evolution_of_man_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a chimpanzee with an image of Michelle Obama, with the text 'the evolution of man'. This visual pairing is a racist trope that dehumanizes Black people by comparing them to primates, implying inferiority and a supposed evolutionary gap. The meme is hateful as it directly attacks Michelle Obama, a prominent Black woman, by associating her with a primate, which is a harmful and degrading stereotype rooted in anti-Black racism. The intent is to demean and insult her based on her race, using a visual analogy to perpetuate racist ideologies.",
