    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_436cbe38",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "dehumanizing_contempt",
      "label": "dehumanizing contempt expressed through racist evolutionary trope",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is one of contempt and dehumanization, conveyed through the racist meme trope that compares Black people to primates. The chimpanzee image is used to imply inferiority, while Michelle Obama is positioned as the 'advanced' stage, creating a hierarchy that is rooted in anti-Black racism. The text 'the evolution of man' reinforces this contempt by falsely suggesting a biological progression that is used to demean Black people.",
