    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f1d69fc7",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the racist evolutionary juxtaposition scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the entire meme scene, which functions as a deictic frame for the hateful stereotype. The meme does not contain explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the entire visual and textual composition is structured to project the user's perspective onto the racist trope of 'evolutionary progression' from chimpanzee to modern human, specifically targeting Michelle Obama as the 'advanced' stage. The user is implicitly invited to accept or witness this dehumanizing narrative, making the scene the primary site of projection.",
